==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Ultra Prism|Fan Rotom|110}} from the {{TCG|Ultra Prism}} expansion.
*'''Spin Storm''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Rising Rivals|Fan Rotom|RT1}} from {{TCG|Rising Rivals}}.
